OL,3,GNEWSABlueprint for thousands of new
OL,4,Ahomes set for vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors are set to have their say
OL,7,Fon a plan paving the way for thousands
OL,8,Fof new homes to be built in a city.
OL,10,FPeterborough City Council's cabinet
OL,11,Fwill decide on 25 August whether to
OL,12,Fapprove a new local plan, which will
OL,13,Fshape where homes, employment and
OL,14,Finfrastructure are built until 2043.
OL,16,FThe city needs an updated local plan to
OL,17,Freflect government housebuilding
OL,18,Ftargets of more than 1,000 homes a
OL,19,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
